            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20+EXO.12.21+EXO.12.22+EXO.12.23+EXO.12.24+EXO.12.25+EXO.12.26+EXO.12.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 12.1–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.1+DEU.16.2+DEU.16.3+DEU.16.4+DEU.16.5+DEU.16.6+DEU.16.7+DEU.16.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 16.1–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every year the parents of Jesus went to Jerusalem for the Passover Festival. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus was twelve years old, they went to the festival as usual. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the festival was over, they started back home, but the boy Jesus stayed in Jerusalem. His parents did not know this; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they thought that he was with the group, so they travelled a whole day and then started looking for him among their relatives and friends. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They did not find him, so they went back to Jerusalem looking for him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the third day they found him in the Temple, sitting with the Jewish teachers, listening to them and asking questions. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All who heard him were amazed at his intelligent answers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His parents were astonished when they saw him, and his mother said to him, “My son, why have you done this to us? Your father and I have been terribly worried trying to find you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they did not understand his answer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jesus went back with them to Nazareth, where he was obedient to them. His mother treasured all these things in her heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 2.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Prov 3.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus grew both in body and in wisdom, gaining favour with God and people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
